58: 	 * Build the worker-side `explore` executor for a session — or undefined for synthetic/home sessions (an
59: 	 * `::explore` session must never recurse into another explorer). Enforces the per-run budget; every failure
60: 	 * degrades to null (the tool renders an honest fallback message).
